Getting another ring above +6 is pointless, your survivability will be
helped more by, say, conflict or free action.

With the number of ?enchant weapon you've come by, I'm assuming you're
otherwise kitted out (speed, mr, reflection, all resistances, MC3,
AC-25 or better).  You could probably get by just fine with a rusty
orcish helm in the primary hand if you had to.

I'd go with Excalibur until waking Rodney, Magicbane afterward (but
enchant it to +7, the extra enchantment far outweighs the cost of
getting special effects less).

And I'd switch to Magicbane before fighting any liches, nagas, titans,
etc

I'd ditch demonbane/dragonbane (dead weight).  Snickersnee is a very
underrated weapon but with excalibur and magicbane you already have a
good backup if you lose one or the other.  So I'd probably ditch snick
too.



